      "writtenOn": "2026-11-03T17:17:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So the supported scales are 1, 1/2, 1/4, and 1/8.  IIRC libjpeg-turbo supports more ratios, is this a zune-jpeg limitation, and what are the implications for chromium\u0027s scaling?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 325,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 327,
        "endChar": 60
      },
      "revId": "4193aacbe3fde23e33ac3a79d8ece0741f58e997",
