        "id": 4159917
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-03T18:52:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fixed: every advertised reduced size now supports startScanlineDecode, getScanlines and skipScanlines. Reduced output uses buffered frame reconstruction, not bounded-stripe streaming, and the packed frame is charged against the decode memory budget. Full-size scanlines keep their existing streaming path. Added native-pixel comparisons for all eight sizes, padding preservation, mixed reads/skips, reset/rewind, exact budget-boundary checks, and growing-input resume coverage. Growing reduced scanlines suspend without publishing a provisional frame until reconstruction completes.",
      "parentUuid": "928d759a_a3eae6d3",
